  m_text: '<color=#E0A040>KESTREL  /  2 x 2 cells</color>

    Small, 2x as fast.
    Fits narrow gaps.

    Pushes 4, carries 4 cells.


    <color=#E0A040>ATLAS 
    /  4 x 2 cells</color>

    Large. Clears the way for Kestrel.

    Pushes 8,
    carries 8 cells.


    Both ships hover when stopped.'
